### 1 OBTENER TODAS LAS VENTAS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/


### 2 BUSCAR VENTAS EN GENERAL
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/search?_id=688ffa49ed7f6afdefde5866

### 3 BUSCAR VENTA POR ID 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/68902670b84c80a671c3e16d

### 4 CREAR UNA VENTA 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "table": "688a76a04c708fdb96d97f9e",
  "orders": ["688a774c4c708fdb96d97fa1"],
  "totalAmount": 90,
  "status": "paid"
}


### 5 IMPRIMIR TICKET (SIMULADO)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/688d9882a5546fea81c6137a/print


### 6 PAGAR UNA VENTA
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/sales/688ef282e809d696b33da85e/pay





